flowchart TD
    classDef event fill:#ff9800,stroke:#e65100,color:#000
    classDef command fill:#2196f3,stroke:#0d47a1,color:#fff
    classDef decision fill:#eeeeee,stroke:#616161,color:#000
    classDef aggregate fill:#4caf50,stroke:#1b5e20,color:#fff

    Start([开始]):::command
    Start --> Consent{已同意当前协议?}:::decision
    Consent -->|否| NotEnabled([退出码 3]):::command
    Consent -->|是| Login{登录态有效?}:::decision
    Login -->|否| AuthFailed([退出码 2]):::command
    Login -->|是| Scan[读取预约列表]:::command
    Scan --> Loop{还有可签到预约?}:::decision
    Loop -->|否| CheckWait{是否等待窗口?}:::decision
    CheckWait -->|否| Failed([退出码 1]):::command
    CheckWait -->|是| Deadline{窗口截止?}:::decision
    Deadline -->|是| Failed
    Deadline -->|否| Sleep[等待重试间隔]:::command
    Sleep --> Scan
    Loop -->|是| CheckIn[调用 checkIn]:::command
    CheckIn --> Verify[列表复核 status=1]:::command
    Verify -->|成功| Success([退出码 0]):::command
    Verify -->|失败| Loop

    Agg[BookingOrder]:::aggregate
    Verify -.更新.-> Agg
